        {
          "$type": "Models.Core.Folder, Models",
          "ShowInDocs": true,
          "Name": "Douglas Daly Row Spacing 2021",
          "ResourceName": null,
          "Children": [
            {
              "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
              "Text": "08/12/2023:\n\nThis site has vegetative branches, starting sometimes at node 1, with large leaf area on nodes 4 and 5. In the current model, branches are simulated from node 7. \n\nAlso LAI relative area is based on phenological stage --> with 10% at flowering / this is at a much higher node number, so for DDRF the early large canopy will never be achieved\n\nRequires:\n\n1. RelativeArea to be based on node number, with about node 3 about 0.4 and 4 0.7 ' flowering 0.6 already compared with 0.2 for narrabri --> because of veg branches!!!\n2. Branching_Rate to start at Node 1\n3. [#Leaf].AreaLargestLeaf.FixedValue should be 0.025 or even 0.06 (Burdekin data)!!!!!\n\nUntil squaring, leaf area mostly from mainstem leaves\n\nLeaf area follows a sigmoidal growth pattern, characterised by a lag phase, an exponential growth phase, and a plateau \nphase. The lag phase was already discussed, and in this stage of growth, leaf area is entirely accounted for by mainstem \nleaves. Sometime between squaring and flowering, leaf area enters an exponential growth phase.\n\n* Site production simulation? Obs vs pred not correct!\n* Parameter R reduce from 0.5 to 0.3?\n\n=========================================================\n\nHarvest Index:\n\nLint: 0.45\n\nSeed: 0.65 \n\nBur: 0.10",
              "Name": "Memo",
              "ResourceName": null,
              "Children": [],
              "Enabled": true,
              "ReadOnly": false
            },
            {
              "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
              "Text": "Stage|RS1000|DAS|RS500|DAS\n-|-|-|-|-\nSowing|7 Jan 2021|0|7 Jan 2021|0\nSquaring|10 Feb 2021|34|10 Feb 2021|34\nFlowering|3 Mar 2021|55|3 Mar 2021|55\nCutout|22 Mar 2021|74|22 Mar 2021|74\nOpenBolls|21 Apr 2021|104|21 Apr 2021|104\nMaturity|19 May 2021|132|5 May 2021|132\nHarvestRipe|2 Jun 2021|146|2 Jun 2021|146\n\nDefoliation on 19 May 2021 & 02 Jun 2021\n",
              "Name": "Phenology stages Observed",
              "ResourceName": null,
              "Children": [],
              "Enabled": true,
              "ReadOnly": false
            },
            {
              "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
              "Text": "Growth regulator application (mepiquat 350):\n\nRate (L/ha)\n\nDate|RS500|RS1000|RS1500\n-|-|-|-\n10 Feb 2021|0.4|-|-\n17 Feb 2021|-|0.4|-\n09 Mar 2021|0.4|0.4|0.4\n26 Mar 2021|0.8|0.8|0.8",
              "Name": "Growth regulator details",
              "ResourceName": null,
              "Children": [],
              "Enabled": true,
              "ReadOnly": false
            },
            {
              "$type": "Models.Factorial.Experiment, Models",
              "DisabledSimNames": null,
              "Name": "DDRF21",
              "ResourceName": null,
              "Children": [
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Factorial.Factors, Models",
                  "Name": "Factors",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [
                    {
                      "$type": "Models.Factorial.CompositeFactor, Models",
                      "Specifications": [
                        "[Operations]"
                      ],
                      "CustomDescriptors": [],
                      "Name": "RS1500",
                      "ResourceName": null,
                      "Children": [
                        {
                          "$type": "Models.Operations, Models",
                          "OperationsList": [
                            {
                              "$type": "Models.Operation, Models",
                              "Enabled": true,
                              "Date": "2021-01-07",
                              "Action": "[Cotton].Sow(population: 4.7, cultivar: Sicot_748B3F , depth: 20, rowSpacing: 1500);",
                              "Line": "2021-01-07 [Cotton].Sow(population: 4.7, cultivar: Sicot_748B3F , depth: 20, rowSpacing: 1500);"
                            },
                            {
                              "$type": "Models.Operation, Models",
                              "Enabled": false,
                              "Date": null,
                              "Action": null,
                              "Line": ""
                            },
                            {
                              "$type": "Models.Operation, Models",
                              "Enabled": false,
                              "Date": null,
                              "Action": null,
                              "Line": "// TOO MUCH N STRESS AT ESTABLISHMENT, THIS WAS NOT THE CASE: RELEASE OF N FROM ORGANIC MATTER GOING WELL? Or is the organic matter tying up the nitrogen?"
                            },
                            {
                              "$type": "Models.Operation, Models",
                              "Enabled": false,
                              "Date": null,
                              "Action": null,
                              "Line": ""
                            },
                            {
                              "$type": "Models.Operation, Models",
                              "Enabled": false,
                              "Date": null,
                              "Action": null,
                              "Line": "//2021-01-07 [Fertiliser].Apply(66, \"UreaN\",10); // Contribution from decomposition native pasture (not working correctly in the model?):"
                            },
                            {
                              "$type": "Models.Operation, Models",
                              "Enabled": false,
                              "Date": null,
                              "Action": null,
                              "Line": ""
                            },
                            {
                              "$type": "Models.Operation, Models",
                              "Enabled": true,
                              "Date": "2021-01-28",
                              "Action": "[Fertiliser].Apply(64.4, \"UreaN\",10);",
                              "Line": "2021-01-28 [Fertiliser].Apply(64.4, \"UreaN\",10);"
                            },
                            {
                              "$type": "Models.Operation, Models",
