                            "([Cotton].Bur.DMDemand.Total+[Cotton].Lint.DMDemand.Total+[Cotton].Seed.DMDemand.Total) as BollDemand",
                            "([Cotton].Stem.DMDemand.Total+[Cotton].Leaf.DMDemand.Total) as VegetativeDemand",
                            "([Cotton].Stem.DMDemand.Total+[Cotton].Leaf.DMDemand.Total+[Cotton].Lint.DMDemand.Total+[Cotton].Seed.DMDemand.Total+[Cotton].Bur.DMDemand.Total) as ShootDMDemand",
