                  "Text": "This sensibility test demonstrates the modelled long term yield and variation in yield for cotton growing near Narrabri in NSW, Australia.  Studies have shown optimal fertiliser N rates of approximately 200 kg N/ha in most years for this region.",
                  "Name": "Documentation",
                  "ResourceName": null,
